  rule: A write to SRC_ADDR, DST_ADDR, XFER_LEN or CTRL of a busy channel is refused with PSLVERR and changes nothing.
  rule: An access to an unmapped offset completes with PSLVERR.
  rule: PRDATA and PSLVERR are valid in the access phase, as APB3 requires.
  rule: IRQ is high while any channel has irq_en set and done or error set.
